# Research routes and production builds need no database configuration.
# P2-A Studio accepts only its generated private runtime.json (0600).
# Set this absolute path in the current shell after initializing a dedicated instance:
# QUIZFORGE_P2A_CONFIG=/absolute/worktree/.cache/p2a/<instance-id>/runtime.json
# DATABASE_URL and PG* are not configuration sources for this local profile.
# Never put credentials, session tokens or config contents in Git or NEXT_PUBLIC_*.
